  "description": "“There's exactly two things I'm curious about.”     \n“W-what are they?”    \n“Our chemistry in bed. And where the bedroom is. That's all I need to know.”\n\nIt didn't take long to realize. Picking him up wasn't some harmless move. It was a deadly mistake where he'd strip me down to the bone and devour me.\n\n“I've never seen such pretty soft flesh before. I probably saw plenty of it before I lost my memory though.”\n\nThe one I picked up wasn't my first love.\n\n“I'm going to make a mess of you. I was planning to from the start anyway.”\n\nHe was a raw, unhinged guy with a devil's horn between his legs.\n\n(Cr TL: Gourmet Scans)\n\n**Original Novel:**     \n[Chapters](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=12416194), [Volumes](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=11999690)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**     \nR19: [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=13321764), [RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/5285001794), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/metatoon079), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/michin_oppa), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000074810), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/69206353), [Toomics](https://www.toomics.com/webtoon/episode/toon/9202)   \nR15: [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=13321786), [RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/5285001795), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/metatoon080), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/michin_oppa_15), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000074812), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/69206370)",
